# ASPIRE's analysis runtime: R 4.4 with indicspecies 1.8.0, and python 3.11 with pandas
# 2.2.3, seaborn 0.13.2, plotly 5.24 and kaleido 0.2.1 (image id 20116a135b32, built and
# checked 2026-09-28 by docker/aspire/dev.sh --build --check, which loads every R library
# and exports a plotly sankey to SVG).
#
# CAUTION: the image is not on quay yet. A host runs it only after it is side-loaded into
# that host's image store: research/aspire/campaigns/cyano_r1/run_cyano.py side-load-images.
container: docker://quay.io/hallamlab/aspire:0.1.0
conda: aspire
